OL,3,GNEWSATeacher's ban after sex offender
OL,4,Afiance jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who failed to tell his school
OL,7,Fthat his fiance had been jailed for sex
OL,8,Foffences against boys has been banned
OL,9,Ffrom the profession.
OL,11,FThomas Ridgway, 31, was a photography
OL,12,Fteacher at Heathfield School, a private
OL,13,Fgirls' school in Ascot, Berkshire, when
OL,14,Fhis partner was imprisoned in December
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FA panel found Ridgway was aware of the
OL,18,Foffences but that the school was only
OL,19,Finformed about them when a member of
OL,20,Fthe public sent the information to it
OL,21,Fby email later that month.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
