OL,3,GNEWSATeacher's ban after sex offender
OL,4,Afiance jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,7,Fsaid Ridgway was "very badly affected"
OL,8,Fby his partner's imprisonment but was
OL,9,Fobliged to inform the school about it.
